---
// Bare /{countryCode}/lesson has no page of its own — "lesson" is only ever a URL prefix for
// a specific class (/lesson/{classId}) or subject (/lesson/subjects/{id}). Someone landing
// here (an old bookmark, a guessed URL, a crawler) means "the classes section", so send them
// to the real classes index instead of a dead end.
return Astro.redirect(`/${Astro.params.countryCode}/classes`, 307);
---
